10
00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:11.860
Oh, I was just kidding! Sorry

11
00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.290
Huh

12
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.420
Let's see what
the cards have to say about

13
00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:24.880
the probability of you
surviving a month here

14
00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:37.450
That's an interesting sword you got there
Where the heck did you get that thing

15
00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:43.080
Hm? It's a fancy-pants
famous one, right

16
00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:48.960
Well. If it's what I
think it is, it's powerful one

17
00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:54.720
You should probably let me
hold on to it Ohh. No way

18
00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.300
You don't even know how to use
it Now hand it over, C'mon

19
00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.160
Kill them

20
00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:10.890
Let's see what this thing can do

21
