24
00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:34.090
Even the lizard's fighting me

25
00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:38.840
Hey, knock it off

26
00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.890
Straw Sword

27
00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:13.630
His sword's creepy!
I feel bad for the lizard

28
00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.760
Observe. That's Minus One Life

29
00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:40.070
