represent the lives of my subordinates

30
00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:49.370
With my Straw powers I can
infuse my body with their spirits

31
00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:55.750
They take damage for me If I amass
ten souls, I can die ten times

32
00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:17.240
Now, let's play a game, shall we A game

33
00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.930
I'm not so bold as to challenge two
members of the Worst Generation at once

34
00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.030
At least not in a fair fight that is

35
00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:40.330
He's a bigger pain in the ass then
he looks Heh. I shoulda expected it

36
00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:50.060
Now let us begin

37
00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.400
Drat. This card
represents internal discord

38
00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:28.340
The Fool, Reversed

39
00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:35.510
A shame. I'll try to draw
a better card next time

40
00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:40.550
Despite the risk of a bad draw there are
cards included that expand one's ability

41
00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.000
well beyond its natural limits

42
00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:15.660
Tama! You gotta hang in
there She feels really hot

43
00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:20.170
That must be why
her dog is freakin' out

44
00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.340
You cowards

45
00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.920
You're not getting away

46
00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.840
Hey, Captain I think
they're getting away

47
00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:35.460
I've drawn a good one

48
00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:43.040
The Hierophant,
Reversed The card of pursuit

49
00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:23.080
Be right back

50
00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:32.090
Won't take long. I'll handle him

51
00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:07.960
Two-Sword Style

52
00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:11.960
Nigiri

53
00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:16.010
Tower Climb

54
00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:20.220
Ripple

55
00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:48.210
Shouldn't we go after them, sir

56
00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:06.520
The Hierophant It's a card of guidance

57
00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:10.690
In other words, a wise figure
will lead them to safety

58
00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:15.690
Man, what a pain in my ass

59
00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:22.410
So. What's the status
on the brat, Luffy

60
00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:25.660
Yowch

61
00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:29.900
Aww, Tama's really burning
up Hey, doggy! Hurry

62
00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.530
Hey, why'd y'stop

63
00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:08.720
Are you kidding me Did you get us lost

64
00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:14.600
We don't have a lot of time to waste

65
00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:20.520
Make up your mind. Y'wanna
try right I advise left

66
00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:26.300
You brave samurai are
simply teeming with strength

67
00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:31.340
Where'd you come from

68
00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:37.350
It's no easy feat to drive
off Hawkins Who are you

69
00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:42.230
The woman you saved earlier
I owe you my thanks, green one

70
00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.800
You may call me Tsuru

71
00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:55.790
<b>Otsuru

Teahouse
Owner</b>

72
00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:02.940
What the hell You were hiding in
that dog's tail the whole time

73
00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:09.380
It's true. My gratitude
knows no bounds, good sir

74
00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:15.560
Oh, dear me! Take this

75
00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:19.280
Wipe her brow and make that
poor child more comfortable

76
00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:24.530
Oh! Thanks I hope this
doesn't sound too forward

77
00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:30.890
However. If it's all right I insist that
you leave Otama in my care You know Tama

78
00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:35.350
Indeed Gotcha! That'd be great

79
00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:38.060
You see, she drank dirty river water

80
00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:41.270
All 'cause she was hungry,
and it really messed her up

81
00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:46.320
Forget the doctor in that case We
should take her to my teahouse instead

82
00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:50.610
Tea? What in the hell
are you thinking, lady

83
00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:56.780
We don't have time for tea when she's
dying I don't even know this pipsqueak

84
00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:02.340
but it's clear that she's
in bad shape You're right

85
00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.840
But the best remedy to
counteract the river's poison

86
00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:08.720
is a special tea and herb blend
that we carry

87
00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:12.010
Heed my advice,
and she'll be better in no time

88
00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:21.520
Okay then. I think we
should do it Thanks a lot

89
00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:28.470
I still owe you a favor I would like
to tend to your injuries, if I may, sir

90
00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:49.400
<b>Okobore Town
Kuri
Wano</b>

91
00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:59.970
Ah! Sweet dango dumplings Nothing
I love better from this teahouse

92
00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:02.360
I don't get to eat these
as much anymore

93
00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:05.290
It keeps me

94
00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:13.580
You say that in jest But before
you know it, you'll be eating

95
00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:17.170
as many as you wish just like old times

96
00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:19.130
Here's hoping

97
00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:24.610
<b>Okiku

Teahouse
Waitress</b>

98
00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:29.590
Hey, geezer!
Timed for you to pack it up

99
00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:33.800
They're closing

100
00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:40.830
Now, Okiku, dear You can't
pay the street tax, right-pe

101
00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:45.460
I've told you before, I'm
willing to help you with that

102
00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:50.920
And all you have to do is marry
me You'd never have to work again

103
00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:54.930
Plus, you can help yourself to all
the fresh food from the farm-pe

104
00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:58.930
I promise I'll make you a happy woman

105
00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:01.970
But I'm far below your social standing

106
00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:06.360
If you're not ordering anything,
then I ask that you leave

107
00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.400
You think I would order
anything from this place

108
00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:14.870
Come on! Eating dumplings made from
scraps What in blazes do you take me for

109
00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:19.870
I would never stoop so low It
would be an embarrassment-pe

110
00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:25.580
Did you forget that I'm a famous
yokozuna at the capital

111
00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:33.970
I'm the greatest sumo
wrestler in the Land of Wano

112
00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:38.020
Urashima!

113
00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:41.940
Quit the teahouse and come with me

114
00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:46.020
I can take you far away from
this poverty-stricken lifestyle

115
00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:52.330
No more selling leftovers to get
by Think of how good you'll have it

116
00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.200
Okiku

117
00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.040
Huh

118
00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:05.690
Otsuru

119
00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:08.980
Otama drank
the river water and fell ill

120
00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:14.780
My goodness Please, lady.
You gotta do something

121
00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:19.860
Okiku! Brew the Evil-Purging
Herbs Yes, right away

122
00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:24.370
Hey! Just who do you think you guys are

123
00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:36.260
Shut your trap.
I don't have to move for anyone

124
00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:43.230
Okiku I'll have a wrestling
match in Bakura Town today-pe

125
00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:47.530
I hope you'll come so I can
show you just how strong I am

126
00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.750
<b>Atop a Mountain...</b>

127
00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:59.330
Did we find them It
looked like the Straw Hats

128
00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:06.660
Maybe I should go n' talk to them
before there's any trouble I dunno, Bepo

129
00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:09.420
Nothing personal,
but you kind of stick out

130
00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:15.090
Better luck next time, pal We should
probably report this to the captain for now
